flowchart LR
    A([Arrives at the app]) --> B[First guess<br/>Price and chart are live<br/>Score 0, no history, empty board<br/>Prompt: make your first guess]
    B -- "picks up or down" --> C[Waiting<br/>Countdown from 60s<br/>Guess card shows the locked price<br/>and how far the price has moved<br/>Buttons off, chart still live]
    C -- "the minute passes,<br/>price has moved" --> D{Right or wrong?}
    C -- "the minute passes,<br/>price has not moved" --> E[Still waiting<br/>Countdown at 0<br/>Waiting for the price to change]
    E --> D
    C -- "price feed goes quiet" --> F[Price delayed<br/>Last price shown with its time<br/>Nothing is decided meanwhile]
    F --> C

    D -- right --> G[Win<br/>+1, confetti<br/>New row on top of the history]
    D -- wrong --> H[Loss<br/>-1, plain result<br/>New row on top of the history]
    G --> I[Ready for the next guess<br/>Score, success rate and streak updated<br/>Buttons back on]
    H --> I
    I -- "picks up or down" --> C

    C -.->|closes the tab| J([Leaves])
    J -.->|comes back| K[Returns<br/>The guess was settled while away<br/>Result and updated score are waiting]
    K --> I

    I -. "keep your score across devices,<br/>take your place on the board" .-> L[Signs in with Google<br/>Anonymous score, streak, history and<br/>any guess in play carried over<br/>Now eligible for the leaderboard]
    L -.-> I
    L -.->|opens the app elsewhere| M[Another device<br/>Signs in, same score and history]
    M -.-> I
